Can you call me back?</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Pouvez-vous me rappeler ?","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275992,"_nanoseconds":285000000}},{"id":"OQRx2eNnp6nW8n4Vzc9U","level":"a1","lesson":22,"part":6,"type":"text","name":"a1-l22-p06-b1","partTitle":"Say it 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Mon numéro est le...</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">My number is...</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Mon numéro est le...","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275992,"_nanoseconds":700000000}},{"id":"DxEYKNl1HnIjthulZ4Wp","level":"a1","lesson":22,"part":7,"type":"text","name":"a1-l22-p07-b1","partTitle":"Listen to the conversation","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"opacity:.8;\">Read and listen to the whole conversation first. You play the “You” part next.</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Imaginez : vous entendez un répondeur. Que dites-vous d'abord ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Imagine: you hear an answering machine. What do you say first?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Bonjour, c'est Alex.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hello, it's Alex.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Pourquoi vous appelez ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Why are you calling?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je vous appelle pour confirmer le rendez-vous de lundi.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I'm calling to confirm Monday's appointment.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Et si vous voulez une réponse ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And if you want an answer?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Pouvez-vous me rappeler, s'il vous plaît ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Can you call me back, please?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Et pour finir ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And to finish?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Mon numéro est le zéro six, douze, trente-quatre. Merci, à bientôt !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">My number is zero six, twelve, thirty-four. Thank you, see you soon!</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275992,"_nanoseconds":707000000}},{"id":"BaNpfgqVLi0lhcRvCky4","level":"a1","lesson":22,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"a1-l22-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Imaginez : vous entendez un répondeur. Que dites-vous d'abord ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Imagine: you hear an answering machine. What do you say first?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Bonjour, c'est Alex.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Hello, it's Alex.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Bonjour, c'est Alex.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275992,"_nanoseconds":698000000}},{"id":"1F6VSdE9dOoELCLjPOqH","level":"a1","lesson":22,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"a1-l22-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\